{
  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nKIOSK ADMIN\nAhmedabad Flagship Store\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nCtrl+K\nAssistant\nLogout\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nKIOSK OPERATIONS\nDashboard\nKiosk Terminals\nOrders\nLive Orders / KDS\nFloor / Tables\nCUSTOMER EXPERIENCE\nMenu & Categories\nMenu Templates\nCustomisations & Tax\nKiosk Welcome Screen\nKiosk Appearance & Content\nKiosk Combos & Deals\nOffers & Coupons\nPAYMENTS & SERVICE\nPayments & Payouts\nReceipt & E-Bill\nPrinters & Devices\nCustomer Feedback\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nReports & Analytics\nSYSTEM\nKiosk Settings\nSync & Devices\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nApp Downloads\nReceipt & E-Bill System\n\nConfigure thermal paper dimensions (58mm vs 80mm), WhatsApp digital receipt templates, and audit history.\n\nRestaurant name, GSTIN, FSSAI and address print from Settings → Report Branding.\nGo to Settings\nThank You & Footer\nThank You Closing Message\nFooter Heritage Tagline\nUPI Payment QR\n\nWhen set, every receipt shows a \"Scan to pay\" QR for the exact bill total — any UPI app (GPay, PhonePe, Paytm...) opens pre-filled, ready to confirm. Pays straight into this UPI ID, no gateway involved.\n\nRestaurant UPI ID (VPA)\nPayee Name Shown in UPI App\nShow UPI payment QR on receipts (enter a UPI ID above first)\nLogo\n\nShown on the on-screen and WhatsApp receipt and printed at the top of the physical slip.\n\nReceipt Logo\nNo logo\nClick to upload a logo (PNG/JPG, under 2MB)\nPaper Dimension & Display Rules\n80mm Standard POS\n58mm Compact POS\nTax Breakup (GST)\nEmail Bill (PDF)\nMark cash bills with a faint diagonal watermark (off by default)\nBills paid by cash at the counter show the word across the slip in four slanted lines, faint enough to read the bill through it. Card and UPI bills stay plain.\nSave Receipt Settings\nLive Receipt Preview (80mm)\n\nSample receipt: a real order appears here once a guest has ordered.\n\nUI AUDIT RESTAURANT A\nBILL / RECEIPT\nTOKEN #101\nInvoice No:\nSAMPLE-0001\nOrder Type:\nTAKEAWAY\nDate: 13 Oct 2026\nTime: 09:08 pm\nPOS: POS-01\nITEM\nQTY\nRATE\nAMT\nSample dish\n2\n₹100\n₹200\nSample drink\n1\n₹60\n₹60\nSubtotal\n₹260\nCGST\n₹6.50\nSGST\n₹6.50\nTOTAL\n₹273\nPAID VIA:\nCASH\nThank you for dining at UI Audit Restaurant A! Please visit again.\nFreshly Prepared • Zero Preservatives • Pure Heritage Taste\nPowered by JAMANVAAR\nDigital E-Bill Transmission Audit Log\n0 records\n\nNo digital receipts dispatched yet. Dispatched WhatsApp & SMS e-bills will appear here with masked privacy numbers.\n\nWhatsApp number for customer bills\n\nWhen a customer asks for their bill on WhatsApp (kiosk or POS), it is sent automatically from this number.\n\n+91\nSave & check\n\nNo number set\n\nBills are sent from the restaurant’s default WhatsApp number until you set one here.\n\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE\nKELVIONTECH ENTERPRISE\nLocal Engine Active\nOFFLINE-FIRST INDIAN RESTAURANT SYSTEM\nv2.0 • POWERED BY KELVIONTECH\n\nYOUR RESTAURANT WORKSPACE\n\nKIOSK MANAGEMENT\nCore Engine Ready\n•\nDatabase Initialized\n•\nLocal-First Mode",
